        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PCF08-LTBL, Blue Ocean Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull is the perfect compliment to glass doors. It is available in 2 beautiful colors: blue or ocean blue. It is made out of high quality, 1 inch thick acrylic. The Blue Ocean Glass Door Pull comes packaged with through bolts for a 1-3/4 inch thick door. Choose from 12 or 24 inch lengths. This colored acrylic door pull is perfect for beach front property!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SGA-colors.jpg?v=1704442265\" width=\"600\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant a different color? <a href=\"/products/colored-acrylic-door-pull-first-impressions-pcf08\"><b>Color Acrylic Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First impressions Colored Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door pull includes installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Door pulls are hand waxed with butcher's wax to add longevity to the life of the finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08012-LTBL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08024-LTBL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable</b> and has an <b>Extended Lead-Time</b>. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Blue  Door Pull",
                "description": "This door pull is the perfect compliment to glass doors. It is available in 2 beautiful colors: blue or ocean blue. It is made out of high quality, 1 inch thick acrylic. The Blue Ocean Glass Door Pull comes packaged with through bolts for a 1-3/4 inch thick door. Choose from 12 or 24 inch lengths. This colored acrylic door pull is perfect for beach front property!\r\n",
